  "guidance": "Remove excess whitespace at the start and end of text. Can accept multiple columns.\n\n:::note\nNon-string values pass through unaltered.\n:::\n\n## Migrated examples\n#### Trimming a String\n\n##### Recipe\n\n```yaml\nwrangles:\n  - format.trim:\n      input:\n        - col1\n      output: col1 trimmed\n```\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-grid\">\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Input Sample\n\n| col1 |\n| --- |\n| `  Hello World  ` |\n\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Output Sample\n\n| col1 | col1 trimmed |\n| --- | --- |\n| Hello World | Hello World |\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
